<title>USA: JDN Realty files $326 mln debt/stock shelf.</title>
<headline>JDN Realty files $326 mln debt/stock shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>JDN Realty Corp filed Tuesday a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $325,844,900 in debt securities, preferred and common stock and warrants.</p>
<p>When combined with previous registration, JDN will have a total offering of $400 million in equities available for sale.</p>
<p>The proceeds will be used for general corporate purposes, the filing said.</p>
<p>JDN, based in Atlanta, is a real estate development operating as a real estate investment trust and specializing in the development and asset management of retailing shopping centers anchored by value-oriented retailers.</p>
</text>
